{"displayStem":"아래는 심낭의 압력–용적 관계를 비교하기 위해 합성 모형이다. 가와 나는 축적 조건이 다른 두 압력–용적 관계를 나타낸다. 그래프의 수치는 실제 환자의 안전 용적·배액 기준이 아니다.","notes":[{"kind":"provenance","text":"교육 목적으로 구성한 학습자료입니다."},{"kind":"provenance","text":"교육용 합성 자료 · 점 사이 직선은 표시용이며 검증된 연속 생리함수가 아님","links":[]}],"evidenceMarkup":["<div class=\"dataset-evidence batch-C03 c03-batch\"><div class=\"evidence\"><svg class=\"c03-p3-plot\" viewBox=\"0 0 620 365\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"추가된 심낭액 (mL)와 심낭압 (mmHg) 자료\"><path d=\"M75 60V270H550\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"></path><path d=\"M70 270h5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"64\" y=\"277\" text-anchor=\"end\">0</text><path d=\"M70 218.75h5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"64\" y=\"225.75\" text-anchor=\"end\">10</text><path d=\"M70 167.5h5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"64\" y=\"174.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">20</text><path d=\"M70 116.25h5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"64\" y=\"123.25\" text-anchor=\"end\">30</text><path d=\"M70 65h5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"64\" y=\"72\" text-anchor=\"end\">40</text><path d=\"M75 270v5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"75\" y=\"302\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text><path d=\"M192.5 270v5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"192.5\" y=\"302\" text-anchor=\"middle\">100</text><path d=\"M310 270v5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"310\" y=\"302\" text-anchor=\"middle\">200</text><path d=\"M427.5 270v5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"427.5\" y=\"302\" text-anchor=\"middle\">300</text><path d=\"M545 270v5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"545\" y=\"302\" text-anchor=\"middle\">400</text><polyline points=\"75,270 133.75,264.875 192.5,254.625 251.25,218.75 310,126.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"2\"></polyline><circle cx=\"75\" cy=\"270\" r=\"4\" fill=\"black\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"></circle><circle cx=\"133.75\" cy=\"264.875\" r=\"4\" fill=\"black\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"></circle><circle cx=\"192.5\" cy=\"254.625\" r=\"4\" fill=\